      <title>拿下世纪难题之后，OpenAI“污染”了数学？</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260911/%E6%8B%BF%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AA%E9%9A%BE%E9%A2%98%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8EOpenAI%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E4%BA%86%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/</link>
